---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "October 2026";
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service • Muhūrta"
  description="Terms of Service and End User License Agreement for Muhūrta: Vedic Calendar."
>
  <div class="container terms-container">
    <div class="terms-header">
      <span class="badge-gold">LEGAL & ETHICS</span>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="terms-date">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-panel terms-content prose">
      <p class="lead-text">
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the <strong>Muhūrta: Vedic Calendar</strong> application for iOS 
        and the website located at <a href="https://muhurta.shindeaditya.com">muhurta.shindeaditya.com</a>. 
        By downloading, installing, or accessing Muhūrta, you agree to these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Open Source License & Software Distribution</h2>
      <p>
        The Muhūrta application code is licensed under the <strong>GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPLv3)</strong>. 
        You may inspect, review, verify, and redistribute the open-source codebase in accordance with the terms of the GPLv3 license. 
        Distribution through the Apple App Store is additionally subject to the <strong>Apple Standard End User License Agreement (EULA)</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Sacred Chronometry & Informational Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        Muhūrta calculates astronomical and solar ephemeris metrics (including Sūryodaya, Sūryāsta, Madhyāhna, Tithis, Nakṣatras, 
        and the 30 Vedic Muhūrtas) based on classical treatises (such as the <em>Sūryasiddhānta</em>) combined with modern high-precision celestial mechanics.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Informational & Cultural Purpose</strong>: All calculations, doshic circadian insights, sleep recommendations (Nidrā Vijñāna), and auspicious time suggestions are provided strictly for cultural, educational, and spiritual enrichment.</li>
        <li><strong>Medical Disclaimer</strong>: Doshic biological rhythms and meal timing guidance do not constitute professional medical advice, diagnosis, or clinical prescriptions. Always consult qualified healthcare professionals for medical conditions.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Voluntary Offerings & In-App Purchases</h2>
      <p>
        Muhūrta is completely free, open-source, and does not restrict any core Vedic or astronomical functionality behind paywalls.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Voluntary Offerings (Consumables)</strong>: Offerings such as <em>Dīpa Offering ($4.99)</em>, <em>Puṣpa Offering ($9.99)</em>, <em>Archana Patron ($24.99)</em>, and <em>Temple Benefactor ($99.99)</em> are voluntary, one-time gifts of Dakṣiṇā to support indie development, server ephemeris feeds, and open Vedic research.</li>
        <li><strong>Annual Patronage Subscription</strong>: The <em>Annual Seeker Patron ($9.99 / year)</em> is an optional auto-renewing subscription.
          <ul>
            <li>Payment is charged to your Apple ID account at confirmation of purchase.</li>
            <li>Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing cycle.</li>
            <li>You can manage or cancel your subscription at any time via your iOS device <strong>Settings -> Apple ID -> Subscriptions</strong>.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Restoring Purchases</strong>: You may restore past voluntary offerings or subscriptions at any time via the "Restore Purchases" button in the app's Contribute & Seva section.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. User Conduct & Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to use Muhūrta in accordance with all applicable local, national, and international laws. 
        You agree not to reverse engineer or disrupt services in any manner not permitted by the GNU GPLv3 license.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Muhūrta and its contributors provide the software on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis, without warranties of any kind, 
        either express or implied. Under no circumstances shall the author or contributors be liable for any direct, indirect, 
        incidental, special, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use this software.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding these Terms of Service:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Email</strong>: <a href="mailto:terms@shindeaditya.com">terms@shindeaditya.com</a><br/>
        <strong>Website</strong>: <a href="https://muhurta.shindeaditya.com">muhurta.shindeaditya.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-container {
    padding: 60px 0 100px;
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .terms-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .terms-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    margin: 14px 0 10px;
  }

  .terms-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .terms-content {
    padding: 48px 56px;
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-primary);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .terms-content {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }
    .terms-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
